<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/technological-literacy> <https://glossarystudio.app/ns/editorialExplanation> "Addresses understanding and selecting technological innovations and their social effects." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/technological-literacy/versions/1> .
<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/technological-literacy> <https://glossarystudio.app/ns/fieldCollection> <https://id.i2idl.org/collections/field/education> <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/technological-literacy/versions/1> .
