<https://id.i2idl.org/definitions/technological-literacy> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "ERIC scope note: Comprehension of technological innovation and the impact of technology on society -- may include the ability to select and use specific innovations appropriate to one's interests and needs" <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/technological-literacy/versions/1> .
<https://id.i2idl.org/definitions/technological-literacy> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://glossarystudio.app/ns/Definition> <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/technological-literacy/versions/1> .
<https://id.i2idl.org/definitions/technological-literacy> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "Understanding of technologies, their uses and consequences, and the ability to make informed decisions about their selection and application." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/technological-literacy/versions/1> .
